## Missing-Chemical Impact and Preparation

Native impact projection is pending. Exact cedrat, white pepper, Haitian vetiver, and the target-specific Ebanol/Azarbre effect remain evidence gaps, not purchase authority. Ebanol, Azarbre, and Tonkarome are stocked. Verify EB's label or receipt before any physical dose. All tinctures and procurement-pending Ambrettolide are excluded.

## Controlled Blinded Test Plan

Compare coded equal-mass, equal-concentration LH-02 and LH-01 samples in balanced order at 0, 5, and 30 minutes and 2 and 4 hours. Judge family recognizability before warmth quality. Liking and similarity are `NOT TESTED`.

## Claim Ceiling

Physical liking, sensory similarity, stability, and measured headspace are `NOT TESTED`; safety and release are `NOT CLEARED`.

